Basically, you are saying at that moment, it is no longer my life, but I want it to be your life.

751
01:52:34.002 --> 01:52:38.002
And I now consider my life as a steward over it.

752
01:52:39.002 --> 01:52:43.002
And then I said at the beginning, yes of course, you have to be active.

753
01:52:43.002 --> 01:52:46.002
Do you have a place in society, build your work.

754
01:52:46.002 --> 01:52:52.002
But now you build it, not as the owner of your life, but as the steward of your life.

755
01:52:52.002 --> 01:52:55.002
To the honor and glory of our Lord in heaven.

756
01:52:55.002 --> 01:52:58.002
And that changes everything, that changes your entire outlook on life.

757
01:52:58.002 --> 01:53:01.002
That changes your entire awareness.

758
01:53:02.002 --> 01:53:06.002
That brings the glory and the blessing of God into your life.

759
01:53:07.002 --> 01:53:09.002
With peace and goodness.

760
01:53:11.002 --> 01:53:19.002
And so you see, the Passover feast is our Easter feast.

761
01:53:20.002 --> 01:53:25.002
In a few weeks we will celebrate Easter again.

762
01:53:25.002 --> 01:53:34.002
We remember, we honor our Christ, our anointed Jesus, who has walked the entire path.

763
01:53:36.002 --> 01:53:48.002
I think it is good to take a moment and let it sink in.

764
01:53:48.002 --> 01:53:50.002
What does this mean?

765
01:53:51.002 --> 01:53:53.002
What does this mean?

766
01:53:53.002 --> 01:53:56.002
How do I stand in this, Tim?

767
01:54:07.002 --> 01:54:09.002
Yes.

768
01:54:18.002 --> 01:54:20.002
Shall we stand, please?

769
01:54:21.002 --> 01:54:26.002
I want to conclude this sermon with an invitation to repentance.

770
01:54:30.002 --> 01:54:34.002
Please everyone, close your eyes for a moment.

771
01:54:37.002 --> 01:54:44.002
We have heard from Bram in this teaching that God is a God of encouragement.

772
01:54:44.002 --> 01:54:46.002
A God of restoration.

773
01:54:47.002 --> 01:55:02.002
A God who, in the time of Ezra, encouraged the discouraged people through the prophet to actively rebuild the temple.

774
01:55:02.002 --> 01:55:17.002
And so Bram has shown that it is the same for us today, that God encourages us through the Son Jesus Christ and through the Holy Spirit to actively build our lives in Christ.

775
01:55:18.002 --> 01:55:24.002
I would like to ask everyone, please close your eyes and think about your own life.

776
01:55:25.002 --> 01:55:29.002
And here is the encouragement you have heard today.

777
01:55:30.002 --> 01:55:33.002
Be encouraged, says God, for I am with you.

778
01:55:34.002 --> 01:55:43.002
Be encouraged, for I am with you, as you actively build your life in the name of Jesus.

779
01:55:44.002 --> 01:55:47.002
Be encouraged in your marriage, for I am with you.

780
01:55:48.002 --> 01:55:52.002
Be encouraged in your work, for I am with you.

781
01:55:53.002 --> 01:55:57.002
Be encouraged in your family situation, for I am with you.

782
01:55:57.002 --> 01:56:06.002
Be encouraged if you have made a mess of your life, for, says God, I am with you and I want to forgive you and I want to restore you.

783
01:56:07.002 --> 01:56:13.002
Be encouraged if much injustice has been done, if much injustice has been done to you.

784
01:56:14.002 --> 01:56:16.002
Be encouraged, says God, for I am with you.

785
01:56:17.002 --> 01:56:24.002
Be encouraged if through discouragement you can no longer see the place clearly.

786
01:56:25.002 --> 01:56:41.002
Just like the people in the book of Ezra, as Bram showed from the well-organized Persian empire, returned to Jerusalem and ended up in a corner where there were just more broken walls, where there was no infrastructure.

787
01:56:41.002 --> 01:56:48.002
And so we can sometimes think about our own lives and God who says, I want to give you fresh vision again.

788
01:56:49.002 --> 01:56:54.002
While all eyes are closed, I want to ask you, come to repentance today.

789
01:56:55.002 --> 01:57:00.002
A new repentance for some people and for some it will be your first repentance.

790
01:57:01.002 --> 01:57:05.002
Maybe you have never allowed the Passover Lamb Jesus Christ into your life.

791
01:57:06.002 --> 01:57:15.002
Maybe you know a little of the story of Jesus, maybe you have heard of Jesus, maybe you have been invited here in the church and maybe today is your first time.

792
01:57:16.002 --> 01:57:21.002
Maybe you have come here a few times, but you have never clearly made a choice for Jesus.

793
01:57:22.002 --> 01:57:27.002
Do you know what the Bible says? Repentance and salvation is something for today.

794
01:57:28.002 --> 01:57:39.002
Repentance is not for when you have rebuilt your life, that you then come to repentance because you can present yourself as a perfect person to God.

795
01:57:40.002 --> 01:57:42.002
That is not how it works, that is the wrong order.

796
01:57:43.002 --> 01:57:48.002
Repentance begins today. Today is the day of salvation, says the Lord.

797
01:57:49.002 --> 01:57:54.002
Salvation is not tomorrow when you have organized yourself. Salvation is today.

798
01:57:54.002 --> 01:57:58.002
And I want to ask everyone, have you made a choice for King Jesus?

799
01:57:59.002 --> 01:58:04.002
Have you made a choice to make Jesus your Savior and Lord of your life?

800
01:58:05.002 --> 01:58:09.002
Have you made a choice to have yourself washed clean by the blood of Jesus?

801
01:58:10.002 --> 01:58:13.002
While all eyes are closed, I want to ask you this question.

802
01:58:14.002 --> 01:58:21.002
Accept Jesus into your heart. I want to encourage you, accept Him into your heart.

803
01:58:22.002 --> 01:58:25.002
Lord, I want to pray for the people in this room.

804
01:58:26.002 --> 01:58:31.002
Lord, that You will warm our hearts through the Holy Spirit.

805
01:58:32.002 --> 01:58:33.002
Lord, that we will accept You.

806
01:58:34.002 --> 01:58:41.002
Lord, that we, as at the beginning of the service, will build an altar of worship in our hearts.

807
01:58:42.002 --> 01:58:44.002
So that we can accept Jesus for who He is.

808
01:58:45.002 --> 01:58:47.002
He is good. Yes, but I am discouraged.

809
01:58:48.002 --> 01:58:49.002
Here is the encouragement, He is good.

810
01:58:49.002 --> 01:58:51.002
Let Him in your heart. He is good.

811
01:58:52.002 --> 01:58:55.002
Yes, but I have made a mess of things. He is good.

812
01:58:56.002 --> 01:59:00.002
He wants to clean up. Sometimes He wants to break down those walls and that seems scary.

813
01:59:01.002 --> 01:59:03.002
But here it is, believe me, that is not scary.

814
01:59:04.002 --> 01:59:08.002
When He breaks down walls, it seems to hurt, but it is good when He does it.

815
01:59:09.002 --> 01:59:10.002
For Jesus is good.

816
01:59:11.002 --> 01:59:13.002
And I want to bless everyone in the name of Jesus.

817
01:59:14.002 --> 01:59:16.002
That we will come to repentance today.

818
01:59:17.002 --> 01:59:18.002
That we will come to the Passover Lamb.

819
01:59:19.002 --> 01:59:21.002
He who died on a cross.

820
01:59:22.002 --> 01:59:23.002
For you and me a sin.

821
01:59:24.002 --> 01:59:26.002
He wants to make you His child today.

822
01:59:27.002 --> 01:59:28.002
In the mighty name of Jesus.

823
01:59:29.002 --> 01:59:31.002
And we all say amen, amen, and amen.

824
01:59:32.002 --> 01:59:33.002
May I have a round of applause please for Bram.

825
01:59:40.002 --> 01:59:43.002
Hey dear people, I want to say hello to my wife.

826
01:59:44.002 --> 01:59:45.002
She is stuck in Australia.

827
01:59:45.002 --> 01:59:48.002
It's not the most terrible place, of course.

828
01:59:49.002 --> 01:59:52.002
On a subtropical island with palm trees to be stuck there.

829
01:59:53.002 --> 01:59:56.002
Only she was supposed to come home on Friday.

830
01:59:57.002 --> 02:00:01.002
Only Dubai is the airport where she would stop in between.

831
02:00:02.002 --> 02:00:07.002
And Dubai has been heavily bombed in the past few days.

832
02:00:08.002 --> 02:00:10.002
So she couldn't fly via Dubai.

833
02:00:11.002 --> 02:00:13.002
And I had to look for another flight.

834
02:00:13.002 --> 02:00:20.002
And yes, Sunday, March 15 is the first, the best flight we could find via Hong Kong.

835
02:00:21.002 --> 02:00:23.002
That is of course a safe route.

836
02:00:24.002 --> 02:00:25.002
I want my wife back.

837
02:00:26.002 --> 02:00:27.002
That would be nice.

838
02:00:28.002 --> 02:00:29.002
So Vanessa, we want you back.

839
02:00:30.002 --> 02:00:31.002
We love you sweetheart.

840
02:00:32.002 --> 02:00:34.002
So we still have to wait a little bit for Vanessa.

841
02:00:35.002 --> 02:00:36.002
But we have a great time together.

842
02:00:37.002 --> 02:00:38.002
Amen.

843
02:00:39.002 --> 02:00:41.002
Hey people, one more thing about that parking lot.

844
02:00:41.002 --> 02:00:43.002
Am I really going to talk about that parking lot again?

845
02:00:44.002 --> 02:00:47.002
It's a one-way street.

846
02:00:48.002 --> 02:00:52.002
So when you pull out, we're going that way.

847
02:00:53.002 --> 02:00:54.002
Do you understand what I mean?

848
02:00:55.002 --> 02:00:56.002
It's not that we're going to drive that way, because then we're going to have problems anyway.

849
02:00:57.002 --> 02:00:58.002
It's really a one-way street.

850
02:00:59.002 --> 02:01:02.002
Tomorrow we are going to start with the new start.

851
02:01:03.002 --> 02:01:07.002
Both the new start, as also the new start.

852
02:01:08.002 --> 02:01:09.002
English version.

853
02:01:09.002 --> 02:01:12.002
So if you want to participate in the new start, the course.

854
02:01:13.002 --> 02:01:16.002
Maybe you want to get baptized this coming Easter.

855
02:01:17.002 --> 02:01:19.002
Then join the course, the new start.

856
02:01:20.002 --> 02:01:21.002
Or the internationals, the new start.

857
02:01:22.002 --> 02:01:23.002
And it's here in the building.

858
02:01:24.002 --> 02:01:26.002
We start here at half past seven with prayer.

859
02:01:27.002 --> 02:01:30.002
At eight o'clock I will join and we will do the course there, the new start.

860
02:01:31.002 --> 02:01:32.002
It's going to be super nice in the name of Jesus.

861
02:01:33.002 --> 02:01:36.002
And I want to bless us all in the mighty name of whom?

862
02:01:37.002 --> 02:01:38.002
Of King Jesus. Amen.

863
02:01:39.002 --> 02:01:40.002
Have a nice Sunday everyone.
